The fixtures in this directory are generated by the scripts in generate/ from the
test suites of npm's projects, and in part transcribe them:

- tree-dumps, shrinkwrap-dumps, yarn-lock-dumps, spec-from-lock-cases,
  load-virtual-dumps.gz: the test sequences, inline trees and fixture directories
  of @npmcli/arborist (https://github.com/npm/cli at tag v11.17.0,
  workspaces/arborist/test). Copyright npm, Inc.
- npa-tables: the test tables of npm-package-arg
  (https://github.com/npm/npm-package-arg at tag v13.0.2).
  Copyright (c) npm, Inc.
- hosted-git-tables: the test tables of hosted-git-info
  (https://github.com/npm/hosted-git-info at tag v9.0.3).
  Copyright (c) 2015, Rebecca Turner

